        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, unprocessed, at extraction
Based on NREL data (NREL 2007)\nTechnology: Average technology.\nVersion: 2.2\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Erdgas\nLocal subcategory: Bereitstellung\nUVEK 2022 source file:11051.XML\n\n
UUID: 6cbab063-1b8d-3346-8803-e432a2903712
The dataset includes data for natural gas extracted from onshore and offshore wells. Furthermore, the dataset includes data for natural gas co-extracted with crude oil as well as for wells that produce only natural gas.
